-- Book of Magic: herb magic, Herbs of Legend and corrupted Millennium weapons (printed 279-294)
-- 97 gear rows.
--
-- One-off data script, run once per environment. NOT a migration - it adds
-- rows, not schema.
--
--   node scripts/d1-apply.mjs --local apps/character-creator/db/~110-book-of-magic-herbs-and-millennium-weapons.sql
--
